{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\110.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Example 3:", "conf": 0.801, "box": [[101, 125], [282, 125], [282, 166], [101, 166]]}, {"text": "Here we will start at 5 and keep adding 10 to each term to find the next term. So, the", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[93, 222], [1439, 218], [1439, 274], [93, 278]]}, {"text": "pattern will be:", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[99, 283], [329, 280], [330, 317], [100, 320]]}, {"text": "5, 15, 25, 35, 45, ..", "conf": 0.826, "box": [[99, 332], [376, 336], [376, 372], [98, 368]]}, {"text": "Example 4:", "conf": 0.861, "box": [[100, 434], [281, 439], [280, 480], [99, 475]]}, {"text": "Write down the term-to-term rule and then work out the next two terms in the following", "conf": 0.941, "box": [[98, 487], [1497, 491], [1496, 534], [98, 530]]}, {"text": "sequence.", "conf": 0.842, "box": [[100, 547], [253, 547], [253, 581], [100, 581]]}, {"text": "2, 4, 8,", "conf": 0.794, "box": [[98, 593], [206, 596], [205, 634], [97, 631]]}, {"text": "The first term is 2. The term-to-term rule is \"multiply by 2\". So, the pattern will continue like", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[94, 641], [1546, 652], [1545, 701], [94, 690]]}, {"text": "this:", "conf": 0.826, "box": [[96, 696], [169, 696], [169, 736], [96, 736]]}, {"text": "2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, ..", "conf": 0.878, "box": [[100, 749], [399, 756], [398, 792], [99, 785]]}, {"text": "6.1.1 PositiontoTerm Rule", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[102, 828], [608, 839], [607, 876], [101, 865]]}, {"text": "Look at the pattern.", "conf": 0.855, "box": [[98, 905], [396, 912], [395, 952], [97, 945]]}, {"text": "4, 8, 12, 16, 20, ..", "conf": 0.868, "box": [[100, 958], [367, 964], [366, 1002], [99, 996]]}, {"text": "Here each term has a position. The first term 4 is at position 1, the second term 8 is at", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[98, 1007], [1452, 1038], [1451, 1080], [97, 1049]]}, {"text": "position 2, the third term 12 is at position 3 and so on. The Position to terms rule helps", "conf": 0.94, "box": [[101, 1059], [1501, 1093], [1500, 1135], [100, 1101]]}, {"text": "us to find out what number is in a pattern if its position in the pattern is given.", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[103, 1110], [1345, 1143], [1343, 1186], [102, 1153]]}, {"text": "Example 1:", "conf": 0.854, "box": [[100, 1193], [282, 1197], [281, 1237], [99, 1233]]}, {"text": "Find the position to term rule to find 18th term of the pattern: 6,7,8,9,10,11..", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[102, 1245], [1392, 1285], [1390, 1323], [101, 1283]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[101, 1348], [252, 1355], [250, 1392], [100, 1385]]}, {"text": "First, write the terms and their positions of this pattern in a table.", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[103, 1402], [1107, 1438], [1106, 1474], [102, 1438]]}, {"text": "Position", "conf": 0.883, "box": [[141, 1489], [271, 1495], [269, 1536], [139, 1530]]}, {"text": "Term", "conf": 0.701, "box": [[138, 1556], [224, 1560], [222, 1604], [136, 1600]]}, {"text": "10", "conf": 0.521, "box": [[1131, 1594], [1181, 1594], [1181, 1637], [1131, 1637]]}, {"text": "11", "conf": 0.512, "box": [[1337, 1600], [1388, 1600], [1388, 1647], [1337, 1647]]}, {"text": "Now find the rule for position to terms", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[79, 1655], [699, 1681], [698, 1721], [78, 1695]]}, {"text": "Position", "conf": 0.831, "box": [[143, 1760], [273, 1768], [271, 1809], [141, 1801]]}, {"text": "Term", "conf": 0.732, "box": [[141, 1827], [228, 1833], [225, 1877], [139, 1871]]}, {"text": "10", "conf": 0.562, "box": [[1130, 1865], [1179, 1865], [1179, 1908], [1130, 1908]]}, {"text": "11", "conf": 0.51, "box": [[1338, 1874], [1384, 1874], [1384, 1919], [1338, 1919]]}, {"text": "Rule", "conf": 0.762, "box": [[142, 1891], [219, 1895], [217, 1938], [140, 1933]]}, {"text": "1+5", "conf": 0.749, "box": [[329, 1902], [401, 1907], [398, 1948], [327, 1943]]}, {"text": "2+5", "conf": 0.626, "box": [[523, 1907], [598, 1907], [598, 1952], [523, 1952]]}, {"text": "3+5", "conf": 0.749, "box": [[722, 1911], [795, 1914], [794, 1955], [720, 1952]]}, {"text": "4+5", "conf": 0.749, "box": [[922, 1918], [997, 1921], [995, 1962], [921, 1959]]}, {"text": "5+5", "conf": 0.749, "box": [[1129, 1928], [1203, 1931], [1202, 1972], [1127, 1969]]}, {"text": "6+5", "conf": 0.749, "box": [[1337, 1937], [1412, 1940], [1410, 1982], [1336, 1979]]}, {"text": "108", "conf": 0.749, "box": [[778, 2079], [849, 2079], [849, 2119], [778, 2119]]}, {"text": "NOFORSALE", "conf": 0.826, "box": [[1162, 2093], [1463, 2109], [1461, 2143], [1160, 2128]]}]}